    "In Apache mod_jk2/jk2 logs, what does 'mod_jk child workerEnv in error state 6' typically indicate? Provide likely causes.",
    "In Apache mod_jk2/jk2 logs, interpret 'mod_jk child init 1 -2' (what is -2 likely referring to, and common root causes).",
    "In jk2_init(), what does 'Can't find child <pid> in scoreboard' imply about Apache scoreboard/shared memory state and what typically triggers it?",
    "Given this real excerpt, infer the most likely root cause and remediation steps:\n\n" + excerpt
]
responses = llm_query_batched(prompts)
